WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Ocean–ocean convergence
The older, colder oceanic plate descends; an island arc grows above mantle melting.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Ocean–continent convergence
Dense oceanic lithosphere descends beneath buoyant continental crust.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Continent–continent collision
Buoyant continental crust resists deep subduction. Continued shortening folds and thickens it.
